+[Autopilot-full](../../skills/igoroh-mode/playbooks/autopilot-full.md) runs a queue of independent PRs to merged. Each PR gets one owner worker that carries it from build through merge, and no owner merges on its own verdict. A swarm of fresh verifiers checks the owner's code-ready head, one worker per slice. A later rebase or minor fix gets one fresh verifier, and only new behavior or a large new diff calls the full swarm again. Only a clean verdict on the patch that merges authorizes the merge:
 
