 ```
 
 [Autopilot-stack](../../skills/igoroh-mode/playbooks/autopilot-stack.md) is Autopilot-full without the merge. You wake up to verified PRs, each with its verdict, and you review and land them yourself. A PR stacks only on a PR it builds on. Pick it over Autopilot-full when you want your own eyes on the work before anything merges:
 
 ```text
-/igoroh-mode autopilot these five changes, but don't merge. i'll land them in the morning.
+/istack:igoroh-mode autopilot these five changes, but don't merge. i'll land them in the morning.
 ```
 
